# Flyway per-tenant migration scripts are placed here.
# Naming convention: V{version}__{description}.sql
# Example: V1__create_products_table.sql
#
# These scripts are applied programmatically to each tenant schema
# via FlywayTenantMigration during tenant provisioning (Story 1.2).
#
# DO NOT add shared/public schema migrations here.
# Public schema migrations go in: db/migration/public/
